[{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0091","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0091.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0221","title":"ja-xklock 缓冲区溢出本地权限提升漏洞","description":"ja-xklock 2.7.1 及更早版本存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，本地攻击者可通过向 xklock 程序提交特制输入触发该漏洞，导致权限提升至 root。该漏洞影响 FreeBSD 3.5.1 和 4.2 系统，利用条件为攻击者需拥有本地账户，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。建议用户升级至最新版本或应用补丁进行修复。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0221"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-06-02T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:54.553","remediation":"升级 ja-xklock 至 2.7.1 以上版本，可通过 FreeBSD ports tree 执行 `portsnap fetch update && cd /usr/ports/ja/xklock && make install clean` 更新；如无法立即升级，使用 `pkg_delete xklock-2.7.1` 移除该软件包，或限制本地非授信用户登录系统作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/freebsd/2001-02/0079.html","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6073","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/286","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/6b6ab35c79a8cf8624d21f1a20325bab41c1211a/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0221.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0221","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2001-0221.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d880529b2028116bddf6c732baf8f599b169f01e/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0221.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/a96652a2a06e880f217d1d6526622d8501dbbd69/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-frwj-g863-562h/GHSA-frwj-g863-562h.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0221.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_150900_151000.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Exploit-List-Ja/blob/b82432e7d59d95