faslmf 目录及 nolicense 文件，但未正确设置这些文件与目录的访问权限，导致本地普通用户可修改其中的关键文件。攻击者利用该配置缺陷可提升自身权限，实现本地权限提升攻击。该漏洞影响 Micro Focus Cobol 4.1 版本，需要攻击者具有本地系统访问权限，CVSS 评分 4.6，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0208"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-06-02T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:53.100","remediation":"限制 `mfaslmf` 目录权限为 750 或更低，并将 `nolicense` 文件权限设为 600，仅允许管理员访问。如非必要，禁用 AppTrack 功能。升级到 Micro Focus Cobol 4.1 以上版本以彻底修复此权限漏洞。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-02/0205.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2359","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20621","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0e6d432d517e5cdf9829125ecfaa3a6437985a0c/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0208.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0208","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2001-0208.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6a25a9384d7c18dfb53a1d1532073678a2c29fe5/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0208.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/a96652a2a06e880f217d1d6526622d8501dbbd69/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-hwj2-mmx8-vwx9/GHSA-hwj2-mmx8-vwx9.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0208.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_150800_150900.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_3.list.dict","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/1d3aa3a766f8945d2717f8c3f4a07fb0ea9c509b/2001.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0082.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0081","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0081.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0206","title":"Soft Lite ServerWorx 目录遍历漏洞","description":"Soft Lite ServerWorx 3.00 存在目录遍历漏洞，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可向目标服务器发送特制的 HTTP GET 请求，在请求路径中插入 `..` 或 `...` 序列绕过路径限制，从而读取服务器上的任意文件。该漏洞利用门槛较低，攻击者可借此获取敏感配置文件或系统信息，对服务器安全性构成严重威胁。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0206"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-06-02T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:52.870","remediation":"该产品（Soft Lite ServerWorx 3.00）已停止维护，无官方补丁可用。建议立即迁移至仍受支持的其他 Web 服务器软件（如 Apache httpd、Nginx）。若无法更换，可在反向代理或 WAF 层面添加规则，拦截包含 `../` 或 `...` 的 URL 请求，并限制 Web 进程文件系统访问权限为最小目录。同时建议将服务器置于独立内网段，减少暴露面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-02/0137.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2346","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20616","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0e6d432d517e5cdf9829125ecfaa3a6437985a0c/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0206.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0206","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2001-0206.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6a25a9384d7c18dfb53a1d1532073678a2c29fe5/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0206.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/a96652a2a06e880f217d1d6526622d8501dbbd69/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-9344-74cj-7q6v/GHSA-9344-74cj-7q6v.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0206.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_150800_150900.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--789c0b67-cb98-46f6-9bb2-01084abd80c6.json","https://github.com/Yuning-J/VulnerabilityClassifier/blob/c0f06c21b73c26b5ee2b75c21a498eb04eada4b5/threatPrediction/cveIDThreatType/cve_iddirtra"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0081.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0059","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0059.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0151","title":"Microsoft IIS 5.0 WebDAV 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Microsoft IIS 5.0 的 WebDAV 组件在处理畸形的 HTTP 请求时存在拒绝服务漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证，通过向目标服务器的 WebDAV 功能发送一系列特制的畸形请求，可导致 IIS 服务进程消耗大量系统资源直至崩溃，造成正常 Web 服务中断。该漏洞仅影响运行 IIS 5.0 的 Windows 2000 系统，攻击复杂度较低。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0151"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-06-02T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:46.133","remediation":"安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS01-016 提供的补丁 (Q301625)，禁用不需要的 WebDAV 扩展。由于 IIS 5.0 早已终止支持，建议升级至受支持的 IIS 版本（如 IIS 10.0），并在防火墙层面过滤对 WebDAV 端口的异常请求作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2001/ms01-016","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6205","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A90","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20664","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/3ffa2a96db84a89f71e1c7ad889e5f4fcc755a48/2001/CVE-2001-0151.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f410e8277949e9113269176595e70bd0c0230a55/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0151.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0151","https://github.com/edoardottt/missing-cve-nuclei-templates/blob/115c94bd1da3cc18977d652d6e78c9f4a5dfc13b/data/year/2