lfile ActiveX 对象，绕过脚本宿主的安全限制，读取目标系统上的任意文件内容。该漏洞影响 Windows Script Host 5.5 及更早版本、Internet Explorer 5.5 及更早版本，攻击者无需身份认证，仅需诱导用户访问恶意网页即可触发，无需任何用户交互操作。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0149"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-06-02T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:45.903","remediation":"安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS01-015 提供的补丁 (2001年3月发布)，或升级至 Internet Explorer 6.0 及以上版本。如无法安装补丁，可在 Internet 安全区域中禁用 ActiveX 控件和活动脚本运行权限，或通过注册表禁用 htmlfile ActiveX 对象作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-09/0305.html","http://marc.info/?l=ntbugtraq&m=96999020527583&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1718","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2001/ms01-015","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5293","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20243","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/3ffa2a96db84a89f71e1c7ad889e5f4fcc755a48/2001/CVE-2001-0149.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f410e8277949e9113269176595e70bd0c0230a55/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0149.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0149","https://github.com/xaitax/SploitScan/blob/938d5f69569a096cf728175efd0ca15f6fd92c6a/README.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/765c58d21032d831d20918314a5f12dad607f124/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0149.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2001/CVE-2001-0149.md","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/smb_nt_ms02-005.nasl","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/36ddac9224d3973c64320c39be98ecc1f1ca5395/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-p9ph-4v96-x6rg/GHSA-p9ph-4v96-x6rg.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0149.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2001/POC-AVE-2001-0057.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2001/EXP-AVE-2001-0057.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0057.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0100","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0100.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0255","title":"FaSTream FTP++ Server 2.0 目录遍历漏洞","description":"FaSTream FTP++ Server 2.0 存在目录遍历漏洞，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可利用 FTP 协议的 ls 命令，在请求路径中包含盘符名称（如 C:）来列出目标系统上的任意目录内容。该漏洞源于服务器对用户输入路径的过滤不严，未限制目录跳转字符，导致攻击者可越权访问文件系统。影响 FaSTream FTP++ Server 2.0 版本，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0255"],"sources":["cve","exploitdb"],"published":"2001-06-02","updated":"2026-06-16","remediation":"升级 FaSTream FTP++ Server 至最新版本（如有）；由于该产品已停止维护，建议迁移至其他活跃维护的 FTP 服务器（如 FileZilla Server、vsftpd）。临时缓解措施：在 FTP 服务器配置中限制 ls 命令的路径参数，禁止包含盘符或目录跳转字符的路径请求。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=98021181215325&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2267","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5977","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20584"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0100.toml"}]